  "claims_supported": [
    "MBS-Halting outperforms tested RGCN baselines on accuracy/compute tradeoff on belief_repair_hard.",
    "MBS-Halting uses substantially fewer expected steps than fixed-step RGCN.",
    "RGCN + ACT-warmup with lambda_ponder=0.01 reduces compute pressure but underperforms MBS-Halting."
