    "general reasoning",
    "stable attractor dynamics"
  ],
  "open_concerns": [
    "possible repair_loss leakage / teacher-forcing concern (not resolved in this version)"
  ],
  "known_limitations": [
    "single task family (belief_repair_hard)",
    "synthetic benchmark generated by the project's own pipeline",
    "repair_loss is central and potentially carries structural supervision (audit needed)",
    "no depth-controlled causal probe yet",
    "no transfer result in v0.3",
    "RGCN + ACT-warmup uses a 3-epoch forced-T8 warmup; it is a strong diagnostic baseline, not pure off-the-shelf ACT",
